WEBVTT

00:04:30.000 --> 00:04:31.158
by coal oil lamp --

00:04:31.182 --> 00:04:34.534
we didn't have electricity
in our farm home.

00:04:34.875 --> 00:04:37.438
And Dad would read poetry to us.
So I always liked it.

00:04:37.462 --> 00:04:39.976
And about the same time
I ran across this one verse,

00:04:40.000 --> 00:04:41.667
I ran across another one.

00:04:41.691 --> 00:04:45.507
Someone asked a lady teacher
why she taught,

00:04:45.531 --> 00:04:48.571
and after some time, she said
she wanted to think about that.

00:04:48.595 --> 00:04:50.475
Then she came up and said,

00:04:50.499 --> 00:04:53.388
"They ask me why I teach, and I reply,

00:04:53.412 --> 00:04:55.912
'Where could I find
such splendid company?'

00:04:55.936 --> 00:04:58.976
There sits a statesman,
strong, unbiased, wise;

00:04:59.000 --> 00:05:01.698
another Daniel Webster, silver-tongued.